"language": "zht",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<h1>哈洗遜<span>‧他瑪</span>*</h1><p>有些譯本將<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen14:7\">創世記十四章7節</a>的哈洗遜‧他瑪拼寫為哈洗遜‧達莫。<em>見</em><span data-bnType=\"resourceReference\" data-resourceId=\"4901\" data-resourceType=\"TyndaleBibleDictionary\">哈洗遜‧他瑪</span>。</p>",
